			<div class="content" id="post-content-2233045">
									

<p>What I meant by that was that, with this being the SCPverse, if something bad could happen, it probably will. So they got lucky once, in that the first universe they ended up being connected to is relatively benign. Any further connections, which the addendum tells us is already starting to happen, should probably end poorly.</p>
<p>The Foundation is one of the the most powerful, if not THE most powerful, organizations on the planet. They have access to capabilities that no one else could dream of. If the Foundation wanted to move between realities, I'm almost certain they could. If the timelines are very similar, the same must be true for the other Foundation. An ally can easily become an enemy, and they have access to all your computer systems. Maybe I am overreacting, but surely that is something that would be taken into account here. The Foundation have back up plans for their back up plans.</p>

